%%label III. Scherzo: Allegro vivace – Trio
%%note A major, with a sudden drop into C major; the Trio in D is a ländler for the clarinet.
X:1
T:Schubert’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Scherzo: Allegro vivace – Trio
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Franz Schubert
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Allegro vivace" 1/4=228
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt] timp [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl. I, II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn. I, II"
V:hn clef=treble name="Hn. I, II"
V:tpt clef=treble name="Tpt. I, II"
V:timp clef=bass name="Timp."
V:v1 clef=treble name="Vl. I"
V:v2 clef=treble name="Vl. II"
V:va clef=alto name="Vla."
V:vc clef=bass name="Vc."
V:cb clef=bass name="Cb."
K:A
V:fl
